---
title: AdviseCare - State Machine - Consent
---

stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> granted : student grants, or grants an advisor's consent request
    granted --> granted : student changes the expiry date
    granted --> expired : expiresAt passes (checked when data is read)
    expired --> granted : student grants again (renewed)
    granted --> withdrawn : student withdraws the attribute or the whole purpose
    expired --> withdrawn : student withdraws
    withdrawn --> granted : student grants again
    note right of withdrawn
        access stops at once
        an erasure request is queued when the attribute
        is no longer granted under any purpose
    end note
